    "Morag Heslop made a full statement at Alnwick police station on the Thursday, with a solicitor beside her and her hands folded on the table. She was charged with Nell’s murder that evening. The following week a police diver brought Nell’s phone up from four fathoms of water off the end of the jetty.",
